_th__rXe1v TableRow_rowCell__NguDK"><div class="TableCell_controls__3E1YK"><div class=""><span>Security Category and Type</span></div></div></th><th style="min-width:208px" class="TableCell_th__rXe1v TableRow_rowCell__NguDK"><div class="TableCell_controls__3E1YK"><div class=""><span>Trading Symbol</span></div></div></th><th style="min-width:188px" class="TableCell_th__rXe1v TableRow_rowCell__NguDK"><div class="TableCell_controls__3E1YK"><div class=""><span><div class="TradedInstrumentsContainer_fieldWithTooltip__V6XUW"><span>ISIN</span></div></span></div></div></th><th style="min-width:188px" class="TableCell_th__rXe1v TableRow_rowCell__NguDK"><div class="TableCell_controls__3E1YK"><div class=""><span><div class="TradedInstrumentsContainer_fieldWithTooltip__V6XUW"><span><span>CFI Code </span><sup><a href="#reference1">[1]</a></sup></span></div></span></div></div></th><th style="min-width:318px" class="TableCell_th__rXe1v TableRow_rowCell__NguDK"><div class="TableCell_controls__3E1YK"><div class=""><span>ISIN Assigned to Securities Represented by Depositary Receipts</span></div></div></th><th style="min-width:318px" class="TableCell_th__rXe1v TableRow_rowCell__NguDK"><div class="TableCell_controls__3E1YK"><div class=""><span>CFI Code Assigned to Securities Represented by Depositary Receipts</span></div></div></th><th style="min-width:128px" class="TableCell_th__rXe1v TableRow_rowCell__NguDK"><div class="TableCell_controls__3E1YK"><div class=""><span>Par Value</span></div></div></th><th style="min-width:128px" class="TableCell_th__rXe1v TableRow_rowCell__NguDK"><div class="TableCell_controls__3E1YK"><div class=""><span>Par Value Currency</span></div></div></th><th style="min-width:203px" class="TableCell_th__rXe1v TableRow_rowCell__NguDK"><div class="TableCell_controls__3E1YK"><div class=""><span>Date of Admission to Trading</span></div></div></th><th style="min-width:173px" class="TableCell_th__rXe1v TableRow_rowCell__NguDK"><div class="TableCell_controls__3E1YK"><di